OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Ftending to die out through the evening
OL,7,Fand although cloudy at first, clear
OL,8,Fspells developing later with light
OL,9,Fwesterly winds. The odd shower may
OL,10,Freturn to the north coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:
OL,13,
OL,14,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,15,FFresher conditions in northerly winds
OL,16,Fwith scattered showers at times on
OL,17,FThursday. Mainly dry, if rather
OL,18,Fcloudy, on Friday and Saturday.
